{"item_uid": "指考98-civics-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "由於第一輪投票各方案未能超過半數，村民針對第一輪結果之前二名的方案再次進行第二輪投\n票，如果村民仍根據自己偏好順位投票，此時乙案獲得過半支持。請問此時採二輪投票，主要基\n於下列何項考量？", "options": {"A": "相對多數治理", "B": "改善權力制衡", "C": "強化決策正當性", "D": "實現草根民主"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "28-29", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 38.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 14.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 80.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 57.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 5.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 80.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [87.0, 66.0, 48.0, 32.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
