{"item_uid": "指考98-civics-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依上所述，如果立法院最後通過稅率調降，下列何者正確？", "options": {"A": "稅率調降之後，政府稅收可能會增加", "B": "利用發票來查核稅務的成本相對較高", "C": "稅率調降，將會減少民眾的消費次數", "D": "稅率調降，會使特種餐飲業家數減少\n- 5 -\n98年指考 第 6 頁\n公民與社會 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "34-35", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 50.0, "B": 38.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 68.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 68.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [73.0, 58.0, 50.0, 42.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-civics-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "civics", "subject_zh": "公民與社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如果立法院想將前述條文修改為：「酒家及有女性『或男性』陪侍之茶室、咖啡廳、酒吧等之營\n業稅稅率25%」，請問對於修法的程序及修法的內容，下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "女性陪侍業者可以直接向立法院提出修正條文的提案，請求修法", "B": "立法院完成修正條文的三讀程序後，修正條文並未因此直接生效", "C": "通過之條文如牴觸憲法的精神，無須經任何程序，即為當然無效", "D": "通過的條文增加特定人的納稅義務，因此相關條文性質為程序法"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "34-35", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 45.0, "C": 24.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 45.0, "p_high": 75.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 57.0, "p_quintiles": [82.0, 61.0, 42.0, 27.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
